#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/debugging/controller.py:64
msgid ""
"Reports may include the ZapZap version, operating system, installation "
"type, architecture, Python/Qt versions, error details, and sanitized "
"logs.\n"
"\n"
"Never sent: messages, contacts, phone numbers, cookies, WhatsApp session "
"data, conversation content, passwords, or authentication tokens.\n"
"\n"
"ZapZap does not send reports. After review, it copies the report and "
"opens the official GitHub repository rafatosta/zapzap. You need a GitHub "
"account to publish the public issue."
msgstr ""
"报告可能包含 ZapZap 版本、操作系统、安装类型、架构、Python/Qt 版本、错误详情和脱敏日志。\n"
"\n"
"绝不发送：消息、联系人、电话号码、Cookie、WhatsApp 会话数据、对话内容、密码或身份验证令牌。\n"
"\n"
"ZapZap 不会发送报告。审阅后，它会复制报告并打开 GitHub 官方仓库 rafatosta/zapzap。发布公开问题需要 GitHub "
"账户。"

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/debugging/controller.py:74
msgid "Notify me when a failure occurs?"
msgstr "发生故障时通知我？"

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/debugging/controller.py:76
msgid ""
"ZapZap can prepare a sanitized technical report locally after a serious "
"failure. You will review it on the next startup.\n"
"\n"
"ZapZap never transmits or publishes the report automatically."
msgstr ""
"严重故障后，ZapZap 可以在本地准备一份脱敏技术报告。您将在下次启动时审阅。\n"
"\n"
"ZapZap 绝不会自动传输或发布该报告。"

