#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/view.py:157
msgid ""
"Avoid GPU-backed video frame buffers. May help with black screens, "
"flickering and GPU crashes."
msgstr "避免使用 GPU 支持的视频帧缓冲区。可能有助于解决黑屏、闪烁和 GPU 崩溃。"

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/view.py:162
msgid "Disable zero-copy"
msgstr "禁用零复制"

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/view.py:164
msgid ""
"Disable zero-copy GPU buffer transfers. May improve compatibility with "
"some graphics drivers."
msgstr "禁用零复制 GPU 缓冲区传输。可能改善与某些图形驱动程序的兼容性。"

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/view.py:169
msgid "Use software video decoding"
msgstr "使用软件视频解码"

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/view.py:171
msgid ""
"Disables hardware video decoding to fix videos that appear white, black, "
"flicker, or cause crashes. This may increase CPU and battery usage."
msgstr "禁用硬件视频解码，以修复显示为白色、黑色、闪烁或导致崩溃的视频。这可能增加 CPU 和电池消耗。"

#: zapzap/features/settings/pages/performance_experimental/view.py:177
